## 5. Design Theme & Creative Rationale

The portfolio draws inspiration from heroic fantasy indie games and illuminated medieval manuscripts. The design language avoids dark themes in favor of a warm, inviting aesthetic that evokes ancient libraries, treasured codexes, and epic storytelling.

### Color Palette
| Color | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|
| Parchment Background | `#fdf6e3` | Main page background |
| Aged Surface | `#f5ecd7` | Card and section backgrounds |
| Burnished Gold | `#b8860b` | Primary accent — headings, borders, glow effects |
| Regal Purple | `#6a4c93` | Secondary accent — section labels, skill categories |
| Frost Blue | `#3a7ca5` | Tertiary accent — timeline dates, progress badges |
| Dark Ink | `#3e2f1c` | Body text |

### Typography System
| Font | Role | Rationale |
|------|------|-----------|
| **Cinzel** | Display headings | Evokes carved stone inscriptions and ancient title pages |
| **Crimson Text** | Body text | Classic serif reminiscent of printed manuscripts |
| **JetBrains Mono** | Technical labels, dates, code references | Modern monospace contrast for technical details |

### Thematic Terminology
| Standard Term | Fantasy Equivalent | Purpose |
|---------------|-------------------|---------|
| Projects | Chronicles of Code / Quests | Frames work as epic accomplishments |
| Skills | The Forge | Suggests craftsmanship and mastery |
| Interests | Sanctuary of Spirit | Personal passions as sacred space |
| Contact | Dispatch a Raven | Medieval messenger imagery |
| Education | Saga of Learning | Lifelong journey narrative |
| In Progress | Quest In Progress | Active adventure |

### Animations & Effects
- **Floating Motes:** 75 particles drift upward across the page with golden, purple, and blue hues, connected by faint ley lines when near each other — creating a living, breathing atmosphere
- **Hero Aegis Orb:** A pulsing, floating circle with nested rotating rings surrounding the avatar emoji, with shifting golden and purple glows
- **Scroll Reveal:** Project cards fade and slide up with staggered delays on page load
- **Hover States:** Cards lift with golden border glow, timeline entries slide right, skill pills bounce upward with shadow
- **Breathing Badge:** The "Quest In Progress" indicator pulses gently to draw attention
- **Timeline Nodes:** Gold dots pulse rhythmically along the education timeline
- **Parchment Texture:** Subtle repeating horizontal lines across the background simulate handmade paper
- **Ambient Glow:** Radial gradients shift opacity across the page background

